   }
  ],
  "correctOptionId": "c",
  "explanation": {
   "correct": "Interna: $\\int_0^x(x+3y)\\,dy=x\\cdot x+\\frac{3x^2}{2}=\\frac52x^2$. Externa: $\\int_0^1\\frac52x^2\\,dx=\\frac52\\cdot\\frac13=\\frac56$.",
   "steps": [
    "$\\int_0^x (x+3y)\\,dy=\\dfrac{5}{2}x^{2}$.",
    "$\\int_0^1\\dfrac52x^{2}\\,dx=\\dfrac52\\cdot\\dfrac13$.",
    "$=\\dfrac56$."
   ],
   "wrong": {
